  "title": "Over 200 operatives linked to ISI-backed Shahzad Bhatti gang arrested ahead of I-Day",
  "summary": "Over 200 operatives of the ISI-backed terror group, Shahzad Bhatti Network, were arrested ahead of India's Independence Day (I-Day) in 2025, marking a significant effort to dismantle the network and thwart its subversive activities. The government reported substantial recoveries, including IEDs, grenades, and CCTV cameras, as part of coordinated operations across 14 states.",
